                <h3>【新品上市】</h3>
<h3>法國瑪琍嘉蘭 LOTUSÉA 聖蓮奢護系列</h3>
<p>✨𝖫𝖮𝖳𝖴𝖲É𝖠 聖蓮奢護系列✨全新上市<br>以珍稀聖蓮精萃為能量核心🪷<br>結合先進護膚科技<br>為肌膚獻上一場頂奢護膚饗宴</p>

<p> </p>
<figure class="post__image"><img loading="lazy"  src="https://GoldenFrance.github.io/GoldenFrance/media/posts/36/LOTUSEA-Sheng-Lian-She-Hu-Xi-Lie-Xin-Pin-Shang-Shi.png" alt="" width="1672" height="941" sizes="(max-width: 48em) 100vw, 768px" srcset="https://GoldenFrance.github.io/GoldenFrance/media/posts/36/responsive/LOTUSEA-Sheng-Lian-She-Hu-Xi-Lie-Xin-Pin-Shang-Shi-xs.png 300w ,https://GoldenFrance.github.io/GoldenFrance/media/posts/36/responsive/LOTUSEA-Sheng-Lian-She-Hu-Xi-Lie-Xin-Pin-Shang-Shi-sm.png 480w ,https://GoldenFrance.github.io/GoldenFrance/media/posts/36/responsive/LOTUSEA-Sheng-Lian-She-Hu-Xi-Lie-Xin-Pin-Shang-Shi-md.png 768w"></figure>
<figure class="post__video"></figure>
<figure class="post__video">
